 "note": "Every asset is read from the player's own CS2 install at first launch by the bundled Source2Viewer-CLI and cached; nothing from CS2 ships in the release. vpk: map = game/csgo/maps/<map>.vpk, pak = game/csgo/pak01_dir.vpk. out is relative to the cache folder. A path or out may list alternatives separated by |: CS2 updates rename files (Dust II's world_physics.vphys_c became world_physics.vmdl_c), the first real output wins. Only map, phys, ents, trig and model rows are required to start; a missing sound, icon or font is logged and the game runs without it. anim rows are CS2's AnimGraph2 clips (late-2026 builds keep agent animations outside the model); fighters remap them onto the agent skeleton by bone name. Older builds still carry anims inside the model. vm_<set>_<clip> rows are CS2's first-person clips on its viewmodel skeleton; the agent's firstperson arm meshes are re-skinned onto it by bone name and the gun hangs from its wpn bone.",
